{"summary":"Shards of Infinity is the follow up deckbuilder to Ascension.","description":"One-hundred years ago, The Infinity Engine was shattered and its reality-bending shards have destroyed most of the world. Now, it falls upon you to gather your forces, defeat your adversaries, and rebuild the Infinity Engine! Will you survive? \n\nBuild your armies by recruiting allies and champions from four unique factions. Launch surprise attacks on your foes by instantly deploying mercenaries. Unlock limitless power by mastering the Shard of Infinity.\n\nShards of Infinity is the follow-up to the award winning deckbuilding game, Ascension.\n\nApp Features:\n- For 2-4 Players\n- 30 minute playing time\n- Network multiplayer\n- Local pass and play\n- Solo play against AI","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":"$9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eLaXJ9ebQQM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jbsZ9jYR1h7mhOYB02VcFz5fdZhiy5vpS9ivA2z3ujt8MAPcciYmihOXDkd6pX-hbQqsyMIuQn6NW-kIHCu7haA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NRjSTNaBWfQtbKEOJmzOYVSgRXQU1n6sjgb_xEHhtlb6zUxi_OlcClh2BbXZ95M7LwICuk5OMhbYxkCoMlkukw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-5cvx-XgJG0C8JvidjOrqh6wXSVuK0ujbpm1Xgc7-_08qYDYOYncYClRx6lu3TZgmYwCW0hLq2E8SjEfV6OCrrU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m6rrXoQzubWYuY4remFVJpM3mWUSojE-1ty9en1RaI5KT17pn1ZUptfwgUZGQf8LkRhbz9WwSvMCRDjH1gCtUFU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/avlVbiqj3daDlKZepcz5zg_hPEdvwBSACbD50zhb6EieeThdJORJwiI-NlZ4QKpo5-WtoD0tm8KVxb0B28ARkQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZdRYeLyveYt2SKBfZyuIfwtbarGLox1YOBjcvPg-WsZi4ZWUX1T8JejMuKcsDm4oZ6kJU00hXjyufzAZ5cox7A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RTs8yOhgdwBjGiuEwyjEpohsciNbZftD-djnFMwo2o7n4E0JQmZ_wQsao6Ic6Ek0h-VWmWiObvDOYkme3aredg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/X75LIeeNP3Dven5YdbxcqqrupjsLilxsNUebcpamvC9w7C35CmIRiLdAZGJjWl1J9RXAmcq-5AFPyr0WvSjjeCI","https